</div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,n,\\rho,\\gamma,A,B\\in V\">\\(M,n,\\rho,\\gamma,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Ord},\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Ord},\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (notions from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(A,M,\\gamma,n)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\gamma\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n\\;\\exists p\\in M^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\gamma\\;\\bigl(\\xi\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,s)\\land s(x_0)=\\xi\\land s[\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_{|p|}\\rangle]=p\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(A,M,\\gamma,n)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\gamma\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n\\;\\exists p\\in M^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\gamma\\;\\bigl(\\xi\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,s)\\land s(x_0)=\\xi\\land s[\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_{|p|}\\rangle]=p\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}projectum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\n\\land 0&lt;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho)\n\\land\\rho\\subseteq(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\rho\\;(\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(A,M,\\rho,n)\\land A\\notin M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\rho\\;\\forall B\\subseteq\\gamma\\;(\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(B,M,\\gamma,n)\\to B\\in M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}projectum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\n\\land 0&lt;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho)\n\\land\\rho\\subseteq(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\rho\\;(\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(A,M,\\rho,n)\\land A\\notin M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\rho\\;\\forall B\\subseteq\\gamma\\;(\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(B,M,\\gamma,n)\\to B\\in M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Definability is evaluated by an explicit set-coded satisfaction recursion and assignment; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> is the first ordinal at which such a subset is missing from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,n,\\rho,\\gamma,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Transitive},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Ord},\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(A,M,\\gamma,n)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\gamma\\land\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n\\;\\exists p\\in M^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall\\xi<\\gamma\\;\\bigl(\\xi\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,s)\\land s(x_0)=\\xi\\land s[\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_{|p|}\\rangle]=p\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}projectum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\n\\land 0<n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho)\n\\land\\rho\\subseteq(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\rho\\;(\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(A,M,\\rho,n)\\land A\\notin M)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\gamma<\\rho\\;\\forall B\\subseteq\\gamma\\;(\\mathrm{DefinableSigmaSubset}_S(B,M,\\gamma,n)\\to B\\in M).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":2031,"backlinks":[{"id":"df78b73a12becb80","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"67304db766f65ebb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ab2162d43c982825","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8Projectum}_S$ (canonical projectum predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3016","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal8-projectum]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","2d9fd66bae7ead5a","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","64f35ba2e87964e0"]}